cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite the software and the article whose design it follows."
title: "bio-cognitive-healthcare-decision-support: a research reference implementation of multimodal, uncertainty-aware early warning"
type: software
version: 0.1.0
date-released: 2026-11-24
repository-code: "https://github.com/archowdhury328-cloud/bio-cognitive-healthcare-decision-support"
authors:
  - family-names: Chy
    given-names: Md Asikur Rahman
    alias: archowdhury328-cloud
    website: "https://github.com/archowdhury328-cloud"
abstract: >-
  Small, tested reference implementation of design ideas described at abstract level in the cited ICAFT 2025
  paper: gated multimodal fusion of vitals, biomarkers and EHR context, an auditable rule layer, ensemble
  uncertainty, offline updates, a federated-averaging simulation and an alert-routing simulation. It is a 2026
  release on a release-chosen task (ICU glucose-excursion early warning). It does not reproduce the paper's
  results and does not establish who wrote code or ran experiments in 2025.
